(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[686]={"source_order":686,"notes":["Faint diagonal fibre or show-through marks in the upper body, near y≈500–1500, were inspected at native scale. They appear to be paper texture or offset rather than writing, but very faint pencil cannot be wholly excluded.","The target is the verso following fol. 343 (Panjabi contd.). Its left edge shows stacked page edges, and the gutter and fold lie near x≈3060–3120.","Beyond the gutter, a narrow strip of the facing ruled page is visible. It is excluded from the target page.","No folio number is visible on the target page. The supplied label 'fol. [343b]' is preserved as metadata only.","Image-reviewed finding: the principal target page (fol. [343b], verso following fol. 343) is blank. The overview and all six native tiles were reviewed. These cover the top edge, the body, the bottom edge, the left margin column, the gutter and the strip beyond it. Only printed horizontal rulings, the vertical margin rule (about x≈780–840) and scattered paper specks and fibres are visible. No ink or pencil writing, ticks, numbers or other marks were identified.","No folio number is visible. The supplied label 'fol. [343b]' is preserved as metadata only.","A narrow strip of the facing page (fol. 344) is visible beyond the gutter at the right, about x≈3060–3508. It is ruled and shows no writing in the visible portion. It is excluded from the target page.","Stacked page edges are visible at the left edge. This is a physical feature, not text.","The provisional inventory listed no blocks, so no block dispositions are required. No blocks were added.","Faint diagonal fibre, texture or offset marks appear in the upper body, about y≈500–1500, and in a few places lower down. At native scale they appear to be paper texture rather than writing, but very faint pencil cannot be wholly excluded.","Very faint greyish diagonal streaks appear in the upper body, mainly at about y≈500–1500, with isolated short diagonal strokes lower down. Examples are near x≈2420–2450, y≈1530–1560 and x≈2180, y≈3800. At native scale they look like paper fibre, texture or offset from a facing page rather than writing. Very faint pencil cannot be wholly excluded at this image contrast."],"records":[]};
